### Keycloak token requests
# Requires the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
# Keycloak admin console: http://localhost:2305 (admin / admin)

@keycloakUrl = http://localhost:2305

### Get an admin access token (master realm, admin-cli)
# @name adminToken
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/master/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=admin-cli&username=admin&password=admin&grant_type=password

### Get an access token for a cdrm test user (direct access grant)
# Requires "Direct Access Grants" to be enabled on the cdrm client
# (currently disabled by default — enable it in the admin console first).
# Swap the username to test cdrm-admin / cdrm-developer / cdrm-productowner.
# @name cdrmToken
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/cdrm/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=cdrm&username=cdrm-admin&password=test&grant_type=password


